2.7. Continuation Statement

The Structured Unified Field Theory is extended by decomposing its foundational invariant into a five‑component operator family and embedding these components into a sovereign tri‑kernel architecture. The resulting Hamiltonian‑coupled system provides a unified operator framework capable of expressing physical, geometric, informational, and cognitive domains as projections of the same structural law.
